1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,020
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,213
=Episode 3=

4
00:00:51,078 --> 00:00:52,358
Your maidenhood has been restored.

5
00:00:53,118 --> 00:00:55,118
Now only the hardest step remains.

6
00:00:55,758 --> 00:00:56,718
Your voice.

7
00:00:57,559 --> 00:00:58,639
We need to change it.

8
00:00:58,959 --> 00:01:00,118
The pain this will cause

9
00:01:00,599 --> 00:01:01,798
will be several times worse

10
00:01:01,798 --> 00:01:03,199
than all you've endured combined.

11
00:01:03,718 --> 00:01:04,718
Hold on.

12
00:01:15,866 --> 00:01:18,170
♪Devotion turns to flame♪

13
00:01:18,186 --> 00:01:20,240
♪Half a life of hate and bitterness♪

14
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:23,920
♪From now on, our paths divide♪

15
00:01:24,133 --> 00:01:27,780
♪The reckoning♪

16
00:01:57,318 --> 00:01:58,158
(Wretch.)

17
00:01:58,679 --> 00:02:00,158
(You've been dead all these years,)

18
00:02:00,559 --> 00:02:02,759
(yet His Majesty still longs for you.)

19
00:02:15,718 --> 00:02:16,438
Your Majesty.

20
00:02:16,758 --> 00:02:18,239
You're thinking of my sister again.

21
00:02:21,878 --> 00:02:22,999
Roujia has been coming to me

22
00:02:23,598 --> 00:02:24,718
in my dreams every night.

23
00:02:25,758 --> 00:02:26,959
Could she be reminding me

24
00:02:27,478 --> 00:02:28,638
that I haven't done enough?

25
00:02:29,598 --> 00:02:30,279
Your Majesty,

26
00:02:30,839 --> 00:02:33,198
you built Guizhen Cottage for her

27
00:02:33,758 --> 00:02:36,318
and ordered your kin to live simply.

28
00:02:37,119 --> 00:02:38,519
My sister's spirit

29
00:02:38,519 --> 00:02:39,598
must know

30
00:02:39,918 --> 00:02:41,079
how much you miss her every day.

31
00:02:49,598 --> 00:02:51,279
Only you know how to comfort me.

32
00:02:52,959 --> 00:02:54,158
You and Roujia

33
00:02:54,158 --> 00:02:55,279
are sisters by blood.

34
00:02:55,878 --> 00:02:57,119
Whenever I see you,

35
00:02:58,158 --> 00:02:59,158
it feels like

36
00:02:59,638 --> 00:03:00,359
she's still here.

37
00:03:05,158 --> 00:03:06,799
If I can bring Your Majesty any comfort,

38
00:03:07,318 --> 00:03:08,839
it's my good fortune.

39
00:03:16,918 --> 00:03:18,038
Wanniang.

40
00:03:19,718 --> 00:03:21,119
Come here.

41
00:03:26,598 --> 00:03:27,559
Take this.

42
00:03:31,478 --> 00:03:33,038
Listen to me.

43
00:03:47,598 --> 00:03:48,198
Mother!

44
00:03:48,758 --> 00:03:49,359
Mother!

45
00:03:49,559 --> 00:03:50,438
Mother!

46
00:03:51,038 --> 00:03:51,999
- Mother!
- Mother!

47
00:03:52,679 --> 00:03:53,559
Mother!

48
00:03:53,559 --> 00:03:54,478
(Don't worry.)

49
00:03:55,359 --> 00:03:56,198
(I swear)

50
00:03:57,318 --> 00:03:58,799
(I'll avenge you.)

51
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:03,120
(Medicine)

52
00:04:03,399 --> 00:04:04,559
Here. This is your medicine.

53
00:04:04,718 --> 00:04:05,478
Thank you, miss.

54
00:04:13,918 --> 00:04:14,718
What's that smell?

55
00:04:14,839 --> 00:04:15,638
Your Majesty,

56
00:04:16,359 --> 00:04:18,119
(Li Dehai, Chief Palace Attendant)
that stall sells medicinal herbs.

57
00:04:18,359 --> 00:04:19,598
It's been there for months.

58
00:04:20,198 --> 00:04:21,198
The owner

59
00:04:21,198 --> 00:04:21,918
gives free consultations

60
00:04:21,918 --> 00:04:23,318
to the poor every day

61
00:04:23,318 --> 00:04:24,119
and provides medicine,

62
00:04:24,758 --> 00:04:26,078
all at no charge.

63
00:04:26,878 --> 00:04:28,159
Word has spread,

64
00:04:28,159 --> 00:04:29,359
so more people are coming.

65
00:04:30,278 --> 00:04:30,878
Your Majesty,

66
00:04:31,318 --> 00:04:32,919
someone so compassionate

67
00:04:33,359 --> 00:04:34,758
is truly a blessing to Daxia.

68
00:05:02,599 --> 00:05:03,239
Your Majesty.

69
00:05:03,559 --> 00:05:04,239
What's wrong?

70
00:05:05,278 --> 00:05:05,999
Nothing.

71
00:05:06,878 --> 00:05:08,278
The Empress's death anniversary is near.

72
00:05:08,838 --> 00:05:10,159
Seeing such kindness

73
00:05:11,359 --> 00:05:13,119
brings me some comfort.

74
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,360
(Medicine)

75
00:05:25,758 --> 00:05:26,599
Xiao Che.

76
00:05:27,638 --> 00:05:28,799
You've finally come.

77
00:05:47,813 --> 00:05:51,400
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

78
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,730
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

79
00:05:56,013 --> 00:05:58,160
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

80
00:05:58,530 --> 00:06:00,173
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

81
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:04,800
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

82
00:06:05,186 --> 00:06:08,800
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

83
00:06:09,306 --> 00:06:13,010
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

84
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:15,420
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

85
00:06:16,026 --> 00:06:17,880
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

86
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:22,040
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

87
00:06:22,346 --> 00:06:26,690
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

88
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:30,690
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

89
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,200
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

90
00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:38,906
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

91
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:42,300
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

92
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:48,290
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

93
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:55,400
♪The past has faded away♪

94
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:59,400
♪The past has faded away♪
